        "narrative": "<p>THE LAKE TROUT POPULATION IS CURRENTLY DOMINATED BY AGE V AND VI FISH. GROWTH RATES ARE GOOD. THE AGE VI, V AND III FISH CAN BE ACCOUNTED FOR BY STOCKINGS, BUT THE OTHER AGE CLASES MAY BE INDI- CATIVE OF SOME NATURAL REPRODUCTION. THE SMALL- MOUTH BASS POPULATION APPEARS TO BE HEALTHY, WITH A GOOD RANGE OF YEAR CLASSES PRESENT, AND GOOD GROWTH RATES.</p>",
