        "surveyID": "111288",
        "narrative": "<p>The lake trout catch in 2001 was above average for lakes of this type in this area, and a wide range of sizes was present.  None of the lake trout collected in 2001 had been stocked.  Stocking of this lake was discontinued after 1996, but the lake trout population appears to be maintaining itself very well.  The smallmouth bass catch in 2001 was similar to past catches in this lake.  The lake supported good numbers of nice-sized bass.  As has usually been the case in this lake, no other game fish, and no panfish, were collected in 2001.</p>",
